msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:92
#: 740be82986b74c4e90938fe45c544e0e
msgid "FlightGear 3D View (Optional)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:94
#: 2b664ebab5a54a8983812b0b9aad3e84
msgid "Developers can optionally install the `FlightGear Flight Simulator <http://www.flightgear.org/>`__ and use it (in view-only mode) to display a 3D simulation of the vehicle and its surroundings. This provides a much better visualization than the 2D maps and HUD flight displays provided by *MAVProxy* and *Mission Planner*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:102
#: e1c7d8c0889b4e4d8767cdcfb4b4dbb9
msgid "FlightGear:Simulated Copter at KSFO (click for larger view)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:104
#: 1cb88a3f2d424ab7b53f1303455515cb
msgid "SITL outputs *FlightGear* compatible state information on UDP port 5503. We highly recommend you start *FlightGear* before starting SITL (although this is not a requirement, it has been found to improve stability in some systems)."
msgstr ""

